  "descriptionMarkdown": "Originally shared by 6180339887 [on Reddit here](https://www.reddit.com/r/factorio/comments/67wber/015_science_setup_all_6_types_1_pack_per_second/?st=J20O5UL6&sh=a19c89a8).\n\nFull [imgur album here](https://imgur.com/a/He44I#slvddcx).\n\nA solid setup for building all 6 science packs (except white / rocket science) based on a main bus.\n\n![labs](https://i.imgur.com/vayUtyRl.jpg)\n\nLab setup. I could extend it more, but for now labs can keep up with the science production.\n\n\n![red and green](https://i.imgur.com/slvddcxl.jpg)\n\nRed and green science. Same as 0.14, these produce 2 packs per second. All other setups produce just 1.\n\n![blue](https://i.imgur.com/y49vbHpl.jpg)\n\nBlue packs.\n\n![military](https://i.imgur.com/8VRVwIal.jpg)\n\nMilitary packs.\n\n![Production packs](https://i.imgur.com/5TW6WWFl.jpg)\n\nProduction packs.\n\n![High tech](https://i.imgur.com/Zy4eRJzl.jpg)\n\nHigh tech packs.\n",
